        "author": "Carson Dann",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "From the first meeting spitballing ideas in my backyard with Dan, to the last day of the install, everyone at Diamond Cut was Professional, accommodating, and friendly. We got turf, flagstone, table Mesa rock, trees, shrubs, bushes, lights, all of it came out great! We also did a dog run and a gate which they came out and changed the direction it was facing at my request after the job was done with no hassle. Just a great experience from start to finish. Highly recommend!",
