        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I couldn't recommend this company more.  Luis went above and beyond what we asked of him, and has created our DREAM backyard.   At our first consult we knew he was the guy for us.  His first consultation was amazing, and he brought his drone to take pictures and then photoshop them to give us an idea of how the yard would look which was SO helpful.\nHe was incredibly communicative, honest, trustworthy, an extremely hard worker, had great ideas, and was the best price.  We had a vision of what we wanted, but also wanted input from the professional, and he gave GREAT ideas.  He and his team worke",
