        "text": "From start to finish every crew that was involved with the building of the pool and landscaping was spot on with their workmanship. They were all on time, friendly and left everything finished and clean. The entire process was done within 3 weeks from the day of the excavation, which was great. Adam came up with a great design and Megan kept us informed all through the entire process. We would highly recommend them and Outdoor Xscapes for any pool or landscape project you may need. Thank you for transforming our backyard.",
        "relativeTime": "9 months ago"
