        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Adam, Hector, Omar, and Megan\nI can’t say enough Thank You for rescuing this project from another company who destroyed and abandoned the job.\n\nOutdoor Xscapes were always communicative of what was happening and respectful of my time and timeline in order to get phase 2 of my backyard completed. Very easy to work with!\n\nThey were able to come in and place a new walkout and main platform and it turned out beautifully! You brought my space back to life and can’t wait to use and enjoy it when fall comes😊\n\nHighly recommend this company to get your dream backyard completed!\n\nI choose a sandblasted",
