        "text": "I hired Big Boss to clean up the overgrown shrubs in my backyard, and they delivered a fantastic result. The transformation is exactly what I wanted.\n\nTheir bid and payment process was completely frictionless. I received a detailed proposal within a few hours, everything was explained upfront, and I could pay online with zero hassle. Communication stayed strong the entire time. They answered every question quickly and kept me updated on the schedule without me having to chase them. Aaron, the team lead, was fantastic and very responsive.\n\nThey were head and shoulders above the three other comp",
