        "text": "We saw Lidio's ad on Facebook and decided to have him come out to quote our backyard. I'm so glad we did because they were able to work with our budget and even made some suggestions that we hadn't thought about when we first were looking to get the yard finished. I just love the flagstone walkway and the patio pad just turned out great. Now, we don't feel embarrassed to have our friends come over for drinks, we have the perfect place to entertain. Thanks, Lidio for the great work and quality of materials you recommended. It really made a difference.",
