    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Suzanne Peterson",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Goodman's did a great job with our landscaping work and I would highly recommend them. They are clearly experts in Arizona landscaping and I would trust them with any future job. Cory helped us with the best plant selections for our needs, and has been responsive and very helpful with any questions or concerns that have come up and addressed them promptly. It's nice to have the peace of mind that they will help guide you through things even after planting is finished to ensure the best quality result.",
        "relativeTime": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Amy Zawadski",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Goodman’s deserves 10 stars! The level of service from the front office, to my consultation, to the landscaping team is the BEST! Amanda & Teaira in the front office are so responsive, enthusiastic & friendly. Bill, who did my initial consult, is the most knowledgeable expert you could imagine. He knows every type of plant, tree & flower; it was like talking to a professor of botany.\nGoodman’s fantastic team put in new Winter grass — I’ve never felt any grass like it, it’s incredibly soft and beautiful. Our guinea pig is enjoying it immensely!\nI truly can’t say enough great things about Goodma",
        "relativeTime": "2 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Brynn Sorensen",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We loved working with Goodmans. They made everything so easy. We had a general idea of what we wanted for our whole yard renovation, but they helped us create a plan that fit inside our budget and was easy to maintain. Joe and is crew were great. Demo and construction were quick and smooth. We would recommend them to anyone redoing their landscape.",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "John Hoskins",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We couldn’t be happier with the work from Goodmans!\n\nMatt and his crew recently came out to trim our trees in preparation for monsoon season, and they did a terrific job. The trees look fantastic—healthy, balanced, and beautifully shaped. Before leaving, they made sure everything was cleaned up thoroughly. The property looked manicured and spotless, which we truly appreciated.\n\nWe also want to recognize Gideon and his regular crew, who come twice a month to care for our shrubs and cactus. Our landscape has never looked better. Everything is neatly trimmed, healthy, and thriving.\n\nA special men",
        "relativeTime": "9 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Bianca Bernstein",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Goodman's has provided us with excellent desert landscaping services for many years. We especially appreciate our current crew--they are efficient, responsive, responsible, and reliable. On several occasions, they have identified and fixed problems before we recognized them. They have done an outstanding job maintaining the trees on our property.  We have also used Goodman's to maintain outdoor lights, the sprinkler system, and weed control. Thank you, Goodman's.",
        "relativeTime": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Paul Studer",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I've been a client of Goodman's Landscape Maintenance now for over a decade. In that time, I have had crew after crew come and perform the landscaping maintenance I am no longer able to complete by myself.\n\nNeighbors and strangers alike ask, Who did such a terrific job on your landscaping? \"Goodman's!\" is always my reply.\n\nToday was no different. I had a new team, Mario and Jason performing. Their attention to detail was great. Everything I discussed with them up-front was executed flawlessly.\n\nIt'll be a pleasure to have them back for my next scheduled appointment. BRAVO ZULU.",
        "relativeTime": "7 months ago"
      }
    ],
