        "author": "Robert and Debbie Leal",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Kim and Chris were great to work with! Their crew is absolutely fantastic! They worked with us when we had to change a couple of things in the middle of the work. They turned our rock filled front and back yards into a beautiful area where we can relax and enjoy our yards. Before and after pics are attached. We love the front patio area and the putting green in the backyard.",
