        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Enchanted Garden did an excellent job of adding large mesquite trees and creosote bushes to our landscaping.\n\nJacob Esau discussed our needs, made suggestions and found the perfect plants. He efficiently managed the project and was communicating with us constantly.\n\nWe were impressed with how quickly his team removed the dead trees, installed the irrigation system and carefully planted the new trees and bushes. They did this without disturbing the existing landscaping.\n\nWe love the new plantings and look forward to watching them grow!",
