        "author": "Annette Wright",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Viva Landscaping did an excellent job on backyard. They were quick and very efficient! The workers were polite and all work was good exactly as described in the invoice. The price quote was very reasonable. I will definitely use them for landscaping and future projects. There are so many landscaping companies in Phoenix to choose from but, I believe that they are one of the best around.",
