        "text": "These guys did an amazing job transforming both our front and backyards! Craig was awesome and listened to our concerns and came up with a plan that fit our budget and it is even better than we imagined it could be. This will cut down the amount of work for my husband exponentially and it is a joy to look out the window now. The little things that weren't up to what we expected were fixed while we were on vacation. Our puppies definitely approve! I cannot speak highly enough for the work ethic of the 4 young men who did the hard work. I highly recommend Grass KIngs for your landscaping needs!",
