    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Danielle Lerner",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I can't say enough about Infinity Landscaping and Pools! We recently had our backyard overhauled with artificial turf, plants, lighting, etc. A project we'd been dreaming about since we moved in 8 years ago! I first connected with Taylor and Lisa in the Fall of 2024 to learn more about the company and get an estimate. We circled back in the Spring of 2025, ready to move forward, and our project was done within just a few weeks! Taylor and Lisa were FANTASTIC to work with. Incredibly attentive, knowledgeable, quick to respond and involved every step of the way. Their crews were FAST, efficient,",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Heidi Phelps",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We had a great experience with Taylor and Lisa!  They were so personable, quick to respond, help answer all questions and keep us updated throughout the whole process.  They did an amazing job on our pool!  Would highly recommend using Infinity Landscaping and Pools!",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Lisa Paulsteiner",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Taylor, Lisa and the whole crew were wonderful to work with.  We needed our backyard completed quickly and they were able to do it in just 4 days.  They worked quickly, clean and efficiently.  On top of being completed in 4 days, it turned out beautiful!  We highly recommend Infinity pool and landscape for any landscaping needs you may have.  They will not disappoint.",
        "relativeTime": "3 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Yvonne McGee",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Taylor is phenomenal to work with. He is professional, dependable and 100% reliable. We really enjoyed working with him and everyone of his crews members. They all work so hard and do terrific work! We asked him to have our yard and pool remodel done by March 1st and he met our timeline even with fitting us in between jobs. We can’t say enough amazing things about Taylor and Infinity Landscaping and Pool. Taylor and Lisa really care about their customers and take care of you!  If you want your pool and landscaping done right call Taylor he is the best!",
        "relativeTime": "5 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Troy Domingo",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I can't say enough great things about Taylor and Lisa!  They were professional, listened, and gave us a design that blew our expectations out of the water!  However, it didn't stop there: throughout the entire project their crews were on-time, worked hard, and Taylor communicated everything to us which was super helpful and we were in the loop on every item which enabled us to make a decision.  The finished product blew us away.  We are super happy with Infinity and will be using them for our front yard, our pool refinish and will recommend them over any other company any day!",
        "relativeTime": "5 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Melinda Hamilton",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We contacted Taylor with Infinity Landscaping and Pools back in September’20. Shared with him and Lisa our dream of our backyard and pool but stated that we didn’t want to start till after Jan’21. Lisa provided a 3D illustration of what our dream would look like. Taylor shared that our Water fall is unique. But the crew started in Mid March and completed just 2 days ago. The crew is absolutely Amazing and we loved coming home from work and seeing the crews progress each day! Taylor, Lisa and their crew exceeded our dreams and now our backyard Oasis is our reality all thanks to Infinity Landsca",
        "relativeTime": "5 years ago"
      }
    ],
