        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We have been very pleased with the backyard renovation by Core Landscape. Aaron and Joe were very communicative and professional throughout the entire process, and the crew worked long hours each day to finish the job on schedule. We are so happy that we chose Core Landscape to help us transform our backyard, and we look forward to using their services for future landscaping projects.",
