    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Nichole Hinton",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We are so grateful for all of the work Silver Fern has done for us!  From removing trees, to trimming back others, maintaining our yard AND for creating the perfect rock scape, they can literally do it all (and more)!  Xavier and his team were recently here for the final phase of this year's yard plans, which was taking 12 tons of rock and refreshing our entire yard.  Needless to say, it looks absolutely amazing and we are so thrilled!  Thank you for always being on time, reliable, and artists at what you do!",
        "relativeTime": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "daniel perkins",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I can’t say enough good things about Silver Fern Landscaping. We’ve been using them for over 6 years, with only a couple of short breaks due to construction projects at our house. Leslie runs an amazing crew, and guys like Chewy, Gabriel, Mario, and the rest of the team are hardworking, respectful, and genuinely awesome to work with. The quality of their work is outstanding—they show up when they say they will, stand by their word, and always leave the place looking incredible. If you want landscaping done right by people who truly care, this is the company to call.\n\nShoutout to Nicole as well",
        "relativeTime": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Julie duvall",
        "rating": 3,
        "text": "I just started with my maintenance in my front yard and so far so good. Very nice people, from my first phone call everyone has been very helpful and asked me questions explained what I needed to know. I’m excited to not have to try to do this myself and to have someone who knows what they are doing come out to help. I have now even asked to maybe have some other things done. It pays to be a company that treats people with respect. Great job I would say hire this company you will be glad you did.\nUPDATE - I guess I was fooled because everything I told them to do after a couple visits they did ",
        "relativeTime": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Jess Heuermann",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Very pleased with our first service from Silver Fern. Our wild jungle of a yard was tamed in just a few hours by their capable team. Glad to have them looking after things from here on out.",
        "relativeTime": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Kellee Garcia",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I had Silver Fern come and remove two of my enormous Mexican fan palms in my front yard. I was extremely pleased with the professionalism and detail they showed on this daunting task. I would like to give props to the Forman Valentine, for being a skillful arborist.\nI recommend this company for your yard maintenance and other landscape needs.",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Karen Mosher",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Over 4 months ago Silver Fern started my landscape maintenance - at that time, Jose did an awesome job and was amazing to deal with.  I hoped that he would be with them for a long time. Sometimes companies can't hold on to their good employees - not Silver Fern!  Jose was out again today, on schedule, did a truly tremendous job and took time to answer questions.  Really appreciate the quality of work and level of care Jose gives as well as Jaimie - who was also a very nice and did great work.\nCan't say enough good about Silver Fern - they are on time, do all the work agreed to and to a great s",
        "relativeTime": "9 months ago"
      }
    ],
