        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I’m extremely impressed with Luis and his team at Chandler Hardscapes. Luis, the owner, provides very honest quotes and offers expert recommendations throughout the entire process. The quality of the turf and pavers was spot-on. They first completed my backyard, and I was so happy with the results that a year later I hired them again to do my front yard. I couldn’t be more satisfied with my decision.\n\nI received multiple quotes from other contractors, and while some offered lower prices, they offer you cheap materials and mediocre work prep. Luis delivers true value for your money without comp",
