    "rating": 5,
    "reviewCount": 20,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "R.C. Bozelli",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We first became aware of Mountain Eagle Landscaping as we observed how beautifully manicured and lush our neighbor's yard was (and our wasn't). She referred us to Mountain Eagle Landscaping 6 years ago, and we have been with Silvano ever since. We highly recommend Silvano for his work ethic, timeliness, communication, and attention to detail. Silvano has done everything from installing trellises, to repairing our irrigation lines, to, of course, the usual yard work such as planting trees, flowing plants, and winter grass, tree-trimming, cleanup, etc. Best of all, his rates are very reasonable ",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Brad Schwartz",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Mountain Eagle Landscaping has been fantastic to work with! Silvano is always kind and a pleasure to talk to. I’ve now switched to them for both irrigation and landscaping, and I couldn’t be happier. I plan to continue their services year-round moving forward and would definitely recommend his services.",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Nylmar",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I had an amazing experience working with Mountain Eagle Landscaping. They took care of my entire yard maintenance, removed a large tree with precision, and completely repaired my irrigation system, which had been giving me issues for months. The team was professional, efficient, and incredibly knowledgeable. They showed up on time, communicated clearly throughout the entire process, and left everything looking better than ever. I couldn’t be happier with the results and highly recommend them to anyone looking for reliable, high-quality landscaping services!",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Shawn Rapp",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Silvano was recommended to me by a co-worker about a year ago. He has proven to be extremely reliable with all things related to landscaping: tree trimming, weed pulling/spraying, fixing leaks with my drip systems, etc... His prices are also very reasonable for the high quality of work he provides. In addition, Silvano is very friendly and punctual. I highly recommend his services.",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Summer Anderson",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Silvano and his team are absolutely incredible! I was referred Silvano by a friend for my backyard renovation and he was nothing short of amazing. When I purchased my home, the backyard was quite literally a jungle (bamboo, 30 ft tall ficus tree wall, 10ft tall weeds, other invasive plants). His team was able to quickly remove all of the plants, limestone, etc and prepped it for my renovation. Silvano was so kind and even came with me and my family to artificial grass retailers to help pick out the right grass for what I’m looking for. He also cane with me to the nursery and the tile retailer,",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Arturo Ruiz",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Silvano and his crew came and did a full tree trimming of multiple trees and bushes, mowing my grass, and treated and removed all the weeds in my house. They were very punctual and their fees were very affordable. I highly recommend them for your landscaping services. Best landscaping experience I've had so far.",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
      }
    ],
