        "text": "Disappointing and Dishonest Experience\n\nI had a discouraging experience with RedCanyon Supply. I purchased 2 tons of gravel, only to find out it was heavily mixed with dirt, which inflated the weight and resulted in less actual gravel. This practice felt dishonest and unfair, as it seemed designed to maximize their profit at the customer’s expense.\n\nI recommend others be cautious and ensure they know exactly what they’re paying for. Gravel mixed with dirt not only reduces the value of the purchase but also feels like a scam. I expected integrity in my transaction, but unfortunately, that was n",
