      {
        "author": "Tyler Wyman",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Had some issues with a pipe leaking underneath my turf that was pulling up all the sand onto the sidewalk. I called Catalina, and they had someone there that same day and fixed it extremely quick! You can’t find a more responsive team in Mesa Arizona than these guys!",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Country Cowboy",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Catalina Landscaping is fantastic! They are professional, responsive, and clearly take pride in their work. The crew is timely and efficient. I really appreciate their attention to detail and their willingness to listen. It’s rare to find a company that combines value and great customer service with top-quality results, but Catalina Landscaping delivers on it all. I highly recommend them to anyone in the Mesa area looking for reliable landscaping services!",
        "relativeTime": "9 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Donna Mattox",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "They were very helpful.  Fixed my sprinkler system leaks in a very timely manner.  Very professional, knowledgeable, and explained everything before hand.  They are family owned and very reasonable.  Excellent job.  Will hire again to remove my bushes and trim the others.",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Richard Castillo",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Charles got in touch within a day or so of appointment and responded with plan to repair sprinkler system. All it took was less than an hour and we were back in business. Recommend all the way! Great Service!",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Terry Wilts",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I removed a Yucca bush and accidentally hit my sprinkler system. Being snowbirds, I had no idea who to call and Cavalier stood out due to solid reviews and being owned by a veteran of our armed services.\nCharles had his crew out in a couple of hours- very knowledgeable and had everything along to repair not only the main line but the distributor as well.\nPrice was very fair and had his people out here in short order. I’d be happy to do business with Cavalier again and so should you.",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Morgan M",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Happy we found these guys. We have had them a couple of times now for a full yard clean up and it’s been a great experience! Good communication, pricing and beautiful work. Such a smooth process. I will recommend them and will keep using them! Thanks Catalina.",
        "relativeTime": "2 years ago"
      }
