    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Glen Traasdahl",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Landen, Brian and then crew did an outstanding job on our backyard.   From design through construction the whole experience was top notch.  I was able to watch the crew from time to time and I could tell that they were obviously caring about quality.   Pricing was reasonable as well. I recommend Helix without hesitation.",
        "relativeTime": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Richard Antonow",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We had a wonderful experience with Helix.  They were very responsive to our request for a quote.  Landon came out, worked with us on “what could be” and then delivered a rendering of the work to be done.  The crew, lead by Luis was fantastic!  They were on time, hard working, respectful of our property and created a backyard that is stunning.  And it looks almost exactly like the rendering.  They cleaned up and removed debris and residual material.  HIGHLY RECOMMEND!",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "C Davis",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We couldn’t be more thrilled with the transformation Helix Landscaping brought to our backyard! From the very beginning, Landen—the owner—was everything you’d hope for in a contractor: professional, responsive, knowledgeable, and genuinely kind. He took the time to understand our vision, offered thoughtful suggestions, and made sure every detail was planned to perfection.\n\nHis crew was equally impressive. They showed up on time each day, worked efficiently, and treated our property with the utmost respect. Their craftsmanship and attention to detail were evident in every step of the process. I",
        "relativeTime": "12 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "John Stefanick",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We used Helix for our rear landscaping and pool. We couldn’t be any more happier. From design consultation, where they listened and designed to our specifications, through the entire build process was superior compared to the 4 other pools that we had built in the valley. Brian’s follow up to any questions and concerns were quick. He has such an easygoing personality which was critical as we built during one of the wettest falls in history. Our backyard is gorgeous and love all the lighting which illuminates the pool and landscaping. We would highly recommend Helix for your pool build and land",
        "relativeTime": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "BA F1",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Great swrvice. Helix totslly transformed our backyard snd we love using it now. Solid 5 stars!",
        "relativeTime": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Melissa Edwards",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Landen and his team did a great job! We had 3 quotes and they were all pretty similar but we thought Helix’s turf was superior so that was the main reason we chose them. We had the whole backyard done, and it was done quick… took them about a week. I had a vision and they really brought it to life. It was exactly what we wanted! They were kind and respectful if i had questions. The kids are so excited to have a nice backyard to play in and we are proud to show it off to our family and friends! Thank you again Helix for a fantastic backyard transformation! Before and after pictures below.",
        "relativeTime": "2 years ago"
      }
    ],
