      {
        "author": "Christopher D",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We recently had Urban Outdoor Solutions design and build our entire backyard — pool, landscaping, everything. The whole space feels like a mini‑resort now.\n\nThe pool turned out amazing, especially the spa. The water feature creates a relaxing environment, and it’s one of my favorite parts of the yard. Everything looks clean, modern, and low‑maintenance, which is exactly what we wanted.\n\nThe lighting makes the whole backyard look incredible at night. The BBQ island area has become the hangout spot whenever we have friends or family over.\n\nThe team was easy to work with, communicated well, and k",
        "relativeTime": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Justin Mowbray",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Any backyard project can be a daunting task, especially when you're thinking about adding a pool. We were lucky to have met Joel at Urban Outdoor Solutions to guide us through this process. He and his team are very detail oriented, and treat every aspect of the project as if it is their own home. They are considerate with scheduling and flexible with design choices. Best of all, Joel is very transparent with the process, prices, and time frame for the projects. Whether it's building materials or plants, Joel and his team go above and beyond to help you choose what's best for your home. Thanks ",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Casey Saylor",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We had a great experience working with Urban Outdoor Solutions on our front yard. Joel was our main contact and was easy to communicate with from start to finish. He was responsive, clear, and honest about options and cost.\n\nOur front yard started out pretty rough: one dying tree, two sad bushes, bare rock, and an old, leaking irrigation system that caused constant issues. We wanted something that looked good but was low maintenance, and they really delivered.\n\nThey walked us through two rounds of designs, checked in as materials were ordered, and took time to educate us on which plants would ",
        "relativeTime": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Thienne Johnson",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We had a great experience with Urban Outdoor Solutions. They updated our backyard by installing turf, adding thoughtfully selected plants, and finishing everything with decorative rocks that really elevated the space. The team worked quickly and efficiently without sacrificing quality, and the pricing was very fair for the results we received. Our yard looks clean, modern, and low-maintenance. We’re very happy with the service and would definitely recommend UOS to anyone looking to upgrade their outdoor space!",
        "relativeTime": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "jessica darley",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Urban Outdoor Solutions completely transformed our backyard into a stunning resort-style space. From the custom swimming pool and pickleball court to the ramada, new grass, trees, pathways and lighting, every detail was done with exceptional care and craftsmanship.\n\nJoel and his team were professional, organized, and incredibly responsive throughout the entire project. He clearly explained the process, kept everything on schedule, and delivered exactly what was promised. The attention to detail and quality of work exceeded our expectations.\n\nIf you’re looking for a landscaping company that can",
        "relativeTime": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Pamela Keidel",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We are extremely happy with the service and results of our project with Joel and his team. We had turf installed in the front and back and new tile around the pool and patio, as well as a new fence (not shown). We LOVE the results. Joel was very responsive and his team even finished earlier than estimated. We’d use them again in a heartbeat.",
        "relativeTime": "2 years ago"
      }
