    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Braden Michaud",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I purchased sod and installation from Evergreen turf recently.  I used them before at another home we lived in and had good a good experience.  Their prices are good and installation saved me and my friends from some labor.  We had an issue arise during installation where some damage was done.  I sent pictures and they resolved the issue to my satisfaction.  Super happy with them and would recommend them.",
        "relativeTime": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Christina Ng",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "Delivery was prompt, correct amount provided, installation was quickly completed. The grass thrived and looked amazing throughout the summer and fall. But despite following fertilizing and watering schedule throughout winter, the grass failed to survive through the winter. Im now seriously contemplating removing everything and starting all over again.",
        "relativeTime": "2 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Tonie Perez",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "Hello , I had sod delivered to my home through lowes and they sent out evergreen turf. The driver hit my driveway fence and damaged it to the point that it no longer functions and will need to be replaced. I have given them two estimates for replacements one from lowes and one from a contractor The company has offered my a refund of my sod however they will not replace the fence as they are saying it was trash anyway and only worth $300.\nI would not recommend this company as they do not take responsibility for their employees they do not respect their clients or the things they work hard for a",
        "relativeTime": "4 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Shelby Lee",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Needed sod quickly, in the peak of summer with scorching heat and these guys delivered an excellent product and delivered it well. Silently in the middle of the night they dropped 3 pallets of moist, quality sod. I've done a few sod jobs in the PHX Metro and it can be tricky with this heat, as well as caring for a lawn and keep it continuously thriving as well. Rest assured Evergreen will provide you a high quality and clean cut sod for you to tackle the challenge, or even repair some areas. This was my first time working direct with Evergreen and in a pinch I ordered online 48 hours out from ",
        "relativeTime": "10 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Ryan Olson",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "What a great experience. Had sod delivered overnight to tucson. It was extremely smooth and the crew placed it in a perfect place. I followed all of the direction and tips on the website. The pictures are of the lawn 3 weeks after planting. It is healthy and beautiful. Thank you. Looks like I need to cut it again.",
        "relativeTime": "4 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Jeff",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "Whoever was driving your truck November 5th in north Scottsdale needs to lose their CDL. Cutting off drivers, going in to the middle lane to pass, an illegal left turn, and speeding through a neighborhood. You should get this in check before they kill someone.",
        "relativeTime": "7 months ago"
      }
    ],
