        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I have been using The Yard Experts for years to maintain my front yard and I never had any complaints. Their crews are skilled and maintaining your yards in immaculate condition. I have been recognize twice as having a beautiful front yard. Due to numerous accidents and surgeries leaving me disabled I was unable to maintain my backyard. They recently did a major clean up of my backyard. I will now be use The Yard Experts to maintain my backyard too. I highly recommend The Yard Experts.",
