        "text": "Ron and his team are great. He came highly recommended by family who had already worked with him. He was incredibly communicative. He and his team are professional and diligent. They work fast with zero sacrifice of quality. Ron's attention to detail was top notch. As he says. He isn't just a landscaper. He is an engineer. And it 100% shows. I would highly recommend",
