    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "j t",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Brandon was great professional and courteous in meeting our lawn care irrigation systems needs. He installed a new WiFi irrigation unit with ease and rerouted a few lines with the utmost skill! We are repeat customers of this business as they are professional knowledgeable and fair!",
        "relativeTime": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Michael Sillanpaa",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I have been calling Sprinkler Doctors for everything in my yard for years now, and they always do fantastic work. They're fast, on-time, and don't upsell. I just had Emerson come to my house to fix and issue I have spent hours on, he was in and out in 20 minutes with everything working great.",
        "relativeTime": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Jim W",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "The office contacted me within an hour of my request and we setup an appointment for the next day. I wasn't sure what was wrong with my drip system but every time it went on the pipes in the house started banging (water hammer). Govani was on time the next day. He said it could be one of two issues and he checked out he cheaper of the two first. Sure enough it was the timer. It went bad and was sending uneven current through the system which caused the water hammer effect. He had the exact model on his truck and replaced it in under 30 minutes. We checked it out by running the system before he",
        "relativeTime": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Long Beach Boy",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I was referred by a neighbor and was very satisfied with their customer service, the technician and overall cost. So many places give you the runaround and don’t follow through, but Sprinkler Doctors was legit. Thanks to Dimitric for a job well done.",
        "relativeTime": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Home Inspector Dan",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I have had nothing but good luck with the Sprinkler Doctors. I couldn't be home for the repairs, but Emerson, the technician, was polite, thorough, and quick! He called us on his way and when he was finished. My anti-siphon and solenoid were repaired and he even wired in my controller to the breaker. I had just replaced it but the new one didn't have bare wires, it just plugged into an outlet. Very happy with the service.",
        "relativeTime": "3 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Kelly Lawler",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We called Sprinkler Doctors because our drip system was flooding our front yard.  Before they sent someone out to take a look, we were informed of what to expect in regards to cost and service.  Emerson called to let us know when he would be arriving and was very thorough, communicative and professional.  He fixed our system and the cost of the service was very reasonable!",
        "relativeTime": "9 months ago"
      }
    ],
