        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Outdoor Concepts is wonderful to work with. The design of our backyard is beautiful, as well as innovative and creative. Their attention to detail is unmatched. They were very friendly and easy to work with. I would recommend Outdoor Concepts to anyone wanting a beautiful and well designed yard. They truly pride themselves in excellence.",
