        "rating": 1,
        "text": "If i could give negative stars I would. The MOST horrendous experience I have ever had with a company. We worked with Sanctuary because they were recommended by Presidential but I am not sure why such a large and good pool company would work with such a terrible partner. It started with Kelton coming out to our yard to learn what we wanted to do. He then put a plan together and its not what you explained so you have to redo the whole plan. We then went into the office and SAT DOWN with him and walked through the plan and where we want plants, lights, pavers, etc and they make you sign a contra",
