      {
        "author": "Kirby Putt",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "In a spur of the moment decision, i randomly called Radiant Landscaping for a yard cleanup. They said they couldn’t get to it till next week, but I was asked when I wanted it done and I said sooner the better because Thanksgiving is tomorrow. Rose, the owner of the company, responded quickly and gave me a quote, that was very favorable to my budget. Within 2 to 3 hours they were over at my house completely transformed my yard. Her two sons work for her and they couldn’t have been nicer along with Javier. Who’s been with the company 15 years. While she was here, I looked at other potential work",
        "relativeTime": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Earlene Haley",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Radiant Landscape Maintenance is the best!!!!  I had an overgrown front yard with the overgrowth as tall as the house.  I called, they came and the overgrowth was gone in an extremely short time.  I am super happy with the result.  I highly recommend you call Radiant Landscape Maintenance for all your landscaping needs.  You won’t disappointed!!!",
        "relativeTime": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Jill Logie",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We just moved to Arizona- into a 10 year-old home that needed a yard cleanup- olive trees thinned, hedges trimmed, and weeding done. I called Radiant Landscaping, and spoke to Rose. She was wonderful! Within just a few days, she came out to look at our yard and give us a quote. She was able to get a 3 man crew to our house that afternoon, with her sons Tyler and Michael leading the charge. They were very pleasant to work with! So happy with the efficiency and our entire crew. We couldn’t be more pleased with the communication and the work that they did. Our crew listened to what we wanted, and",
        "relativeTime": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Jackie Kieffer",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Rose was great! Efficient and professional. We had a large mesquite tree cut down and the crew did a wonderful job. The clean up was good also, they were careful to get all the branches and thorns picked up around where they did the work. Everyone was polite and easy to work with, thanks!",
        "relativeTime": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "heathershmoop",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Radiant Landscape Maintenance exceeded our expectations in every way. From the initial consultation to the final touches, their professionalism and dedication to quality were evident at every step.\n\nThey carefully trimmed our large tree, preserving its natural shape and shade while addressing areas of concern and maintaining safety. The crew worked efficiently, and the job site was left spotless upon completion, surpassing our expectations for tidiness.\n\nBeyond the impressive tree work, this company also provided excellent lawn care services. Our lawn, which was in desperate need of attention,",
        "relativeTime": "10 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Susan Handwerk",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Radiant was referred to me and I am happy to do the same.  They thoroughly took care of all my landscaping needs in the front and back yards including weeds, shrubbery/cactus and a tree.  They did a great job and prices are very reasonable.  They are efficient and friendly and I will definitely be using them for my future landscaping needs.  Thank you so much for doing such a great job!",
        "relativeTime": "6 months ago"
      }
