        "rating": 1,
        "text": "I witnessed extremely unsafe behavior from one of this company’s workers at Vista Allegre park. The employee drove a mower directly toward two women on the sidewalk without slowing down or giving them space, even following behind. It looked aggressive and careless, and the women had to move out of the way. This is unacceptable for a company working in public areas.",
