      {
        "author": "Debbie Andree",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "I contacted Four Seasons to trim up my yard.  Though a bit overpriced, I had them continue.  They did a great job until it came to the four bushes in my backyard.  They didn't shape them up; they only ran a trimmer across the front, flattening them.  I called Lenin, the owner, and told him about it. He said he'd have them come out again to take care of it.  Three calls later, they've never shown up.",
        "relativeTime": "12 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Lindsey Sobczuk",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "We have tried using this company for the last few years. What was supposed to be service every other week on Thursday was never consistent. We tried to be understanding when we would get messages to move service to different days. But over time, it became regular practice for them to show up on random days at random times. Having dogs and a locked back yard, there was no way to prepare for them. Especially when we were already at work for the day. After 3 years of working with them, I requested a consistent day and was told that they have to change the schedule regularly and cannot accommodate",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Pete Barrera",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Lenin has aome top notched crews and is a man of his word companies great!",
        "relativeTime": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Christopher Walker",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Lenin and his team are the very best! We've had them out 3 times over the years, and they've done an excellent job every time. They can take on any mess, overgrown tree, etc and leave the trees looking great and yard spotless. The price is always really reasonable too, and it's very easy to schedule. I highly recommend to anybody in the Valley. Keep up the great work!",
        "relativeTime": "6 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Leigh Chilton",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Lenin and his team recently handled a total yard cleanup for us.  The place was a mess and hadn’t been maintained for some time.  These guys were fantastic and did a wonderful job for us at a very reasonable price.  We were very impressed with how thorough they were.  We even decided to hire them for regular bi-monthly maintenance.  HIGHLY RECOMMEND!!!!!!!!!",
        "relativeTime": "7 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "L.A. “AGirlBlewByU”",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I had alot of clean up to get done and trimming in my yard. They were in and out sooo fast.  When I came home I noticed that they missed cutting out a tree in the front yard. I messaged them and they were back out a couple hours later to fix it… after they were already paid for the job.\nGreat work, fast and integrity! Gotta love it.",
        "relativeTime": "2 years ago"
      }
