    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Michael Hart",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Jake and his team at Camelback Hardscapes completely transformed my backyard, and I couldn’t be happier with how it turned out. They put in a built-in fireplace and grill, travertine pavers, a new wall, full irrigation and lighting, sod, and even a bocce court. I had a vision for what I wanted, and they really took the time to make sure every detail was just right.\n\nThe quality of their work is amazing — the travertine, fireplace, and grill especially — and they were reliable, easy to communicate with, and finished right on schedule. Everything turned out perfect. I was so impressed that I now",
        "relativeTime": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Tyler Naven",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Camelback Hardscapes did an amazing transformation of our backyard, see before and after pictures. Jake and Jorge and their entire team were awesome to work with, easy to communicate, and got the job done! I would highly, highly, recommend to anyone looking to remodel their backyards. We went from empty dirt lot to a backyard that we love to spend all of our time! We look forward to hiring them again, this time for our front yard!",
        "relativeTime": "9 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Willliam Quinn",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We engaged Camelback Hardscapes to do an extensive outdoor renovation (both Hardscaping and landscaping) and are very pleased with the result.  Our primary contact was Jake, one of its two owners.  Jake was great to deal with.  Very responsive when we reached out to him and he had many good design ideas that greatly contributed to the outcome.  Jorge, the other owner was also fantastic.  He did a good job managing the work crew and keeping the project moving.  Jake, Jorge, and the entire crew worked hard to ensure we are satisfied with the results.  We highly recommend them.",
        "relativeTime": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Ranelle",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I’m absolutely thrilled with my front yard renovation by Camelback Hardscapes. Jake was very responsive and accommodated my numerous questions and last minute changes.  His planning and design were meticulous with every detail exactly as I requested from the brick columns and herring bone pavers to the custom gates. Jorge and team were amazing, working long hours to complete the job on time with excellent craftsmanship.\nI look forward to working with the team again for my backyard renovation!",
        "relativeTime": "12 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Jaime Hallera",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "As an out of state investor, I couldn't be happier with the work Camelback Hardscapes did on my backyard! Jake was incredibly responsive and helpful throughout the entire process, providing expert recommendations and a reasonable quote that put my mind at ease.\nThe team at Camelback Hardscapes transformed my backyard into a stunning oasis. They built a beautiful pergola for my spa, a cozy fire pit, a unique area for a life-sized chessboard set, a horseshoe pit, and even a putting green. The craftsmanship was top-notch, and they completed the project on time and within budget.\nI would highly re",
        "relativeTime": "2 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Mark Kaplin",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Jake was very attentive throughout the entire project. His team was very flexible when changes were requested and had some great ideas during various phases of the project.  Our yard looks beautiful and is officially our sanctuary.  Jorge, like Jake, was attentive to details and also very flexible to changes we requested.  They stayed on track with the timeline to complete the project and cleaned up when all of the work was completed\nThey were very easy to work with and would refer them to anyone looking to renovate their yard\nHats off to Camelback Hardscapes",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
      }
    ],
