        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Johnny of Outdoorscapes was my designer. He revised and worked with me on the design until it was within my budget and exactly what I envisioned.  They showed up on time every day and completed the work in a timely manner and have even come back to redo some things that needed repair such as a tile the pool guy broke and a light the wind knocked over. I would definitely recommend meeting with them to see how they can give you your dream backyard!",
