        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I had them repair a small section of lawn that had been damaged by water pooling. They regraded the soil so water drains away properly and put down seed. Their explanation of how the slope would redirect the water made sense and so far it has worked well after recent rains. The seeded patch is already sprouting, and the area looks more level. The staff handled the project with clear knowledge and care.",
