        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We had a full tear-out and rebuild done in the front yard. These guys removed the patchy lawn, reshaped the planting beds, and laid out a gravel path with steel edging. The plants are spaced nicely and it already looks easier to keep up. I had to follow up once about the lighting timer, but they responded quick!",
