        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I worked with Trusted Terrain Landscaping on a drainage correction and grading issue in my side yard, and they handled it with care and solid planning. They assessed the slope, adjusted the grading, and installed a simple drainage solution that now directs water away from the house. The crew communicated each step, and I could see the progress daily. The yard dries faster now after heavy rain, which was the main concern. They kept tools organized and respected the property. The result is functional and visually tidy, and the process felt well managed from start to finish.",
