        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Big Bully Turf did a fantastic job! Their patented turf was impressive from the get-go as I had 2 other companies give me a quote on turf installation; there’s had a black bottom which would absorb heat from the AZ sun vs. the pink of the Big Bully turf. I chose their “natural” turf as we liked the speckled bits of yellow giving it a natural appearance. I asked if they could go right up to my pool equipment and they were able to go around the piping and everything…it looks so clean! I paid $9k for the whole job even though the other companies came in around $6500k I chose Big Bully since they ",
