    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Kristi Long",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We met TJ at the Home Show. He was our last bid for doing our backyard and his plans were amazing! Very creative and so much better than the rest of the bids. TJ and his crew were exceptional to work with. It was truly a partnership. We were so happy with the backyard that a few months later we hired the team to rearrange and enhance our front yard. I highly recommend this company!",
        "relativeTime": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Brian Porter",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "When it came time to finish the backyard of our newly constructed home, we began our search by attending multiple Home Shows. The choices we faced were many. Do we go with a one-stop shop pool company, a special general pool contractor that would coordinate all the work or look to hire a Landscaper and separate pool company? We decided to go with the latter choice.\nWe met Sarah Alton from Desert Designers at one of the shows and kept her card until we were ready. Our initial conversation with Sarah convinced us she wanted to give us the yard we wanted because she listened to what we wanted. Sh",
        "relativeTime": "11 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Dan Martin",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Design is right in the name and that's what sets Rob and his team apart. They came up with a significantly better design than we could have imagined and much better than the other companies we tried to work with. You have to be diligent to review work and ask for little fixes, but no more than with any other good contractor. They were responsive in fixing everything to my satisfaction with an exceptional final product.\nUPDATE: Had a small leak develop somehow... Rob and his team came out and fixed everything under warranty as promised at the onset. You can trust Rob from the beginning all the ",
        "relativeTime": "7 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Tom Callagy",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "When we purchased our home we had big plans to remodel our backyard.  After speaking to several designers we decided to work with Rob Plowright from Desert Designers.  He took all of our ideas and a bunch of his own to put a design together that turned out amazing.  We needed someone who could work together with our pool company to ensure that everything was finished on time and on budget.  Rob's team showed up on time and were there every day until the project was completed.  I would recommend Rob and Desert Designers to anyone looking to transform their outdoor living space to something real",
        "relativeTime": "9 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Mark Davis",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "This is the 3rd time I've hired Desert Designer to do a project for me (2 at previously owned homes). We completed a new build in May 2017 in Buckeye on bit of a hillside. I gave our designer, Cory, our inspirations for a zen backyard. It isn't a large yard and I wanted to create a calm relaxing space. Additionally, I wanted part of the yard to serve as a pollinator area for bees and butterflies. Cory came up with a fantastic solution. We went back and forth on a few of the details and he worked within our budget. The finished project is just as amazing as our prior projects. Thank you so much",
        "relativeTime": "9 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Paul",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Rob designed the perfect backyard experience for our family. The pool now looks fantastic landscaping perfectly done and we now have a miniature putting course that the kids and the parents love.",
        "relativeTime": "3 years ago"
      }
    ],
