        "text": "Glen C Landscaping did an absolutely amazing job transforming both our front yard and backyard! In the backyard, they added beautiful plants and diverse foliage, along with a new drip line to ensure every plant gets the right amount of water. For the front yard, they took our vision of a desert oasis and brought it to life—removing all the old plants, adding stunning new desert plants, and creating a gorgeous paver walkway that runs alongside our driveway.\nThey were extremely fast, starting the project quickly and completing everything within just a few days. The quality of their work is outst",
