      {
        "author": "Jen M",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Gustavo and his team were great and always able to adapt to our changing needs. Always prompt and courteous - very knowledgable regarding lawn care. I highly recommend Reyes Lawn Service for their customer service and expertise 😊",
        "relativeTime": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Mr. Adam",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Reyes Lawn did a fantastic job on my yard! Cleared all the weeds down to the rock, trimmed my roses and other bushes very nicely, and cleaned up every scrap of trash/debris before leaving.\n\nThey were really friendly as well, doing business with them was a breeze. Their monthly maintenance price is great, I'm looking forward to having them back each month!\n\n10/10 would highly recommend their services.",
        "relativeTime": "5 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Johnetta Jackson",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Best service ever. The weeds grew 3 times the size then the pic and they got it done in 30 minutes thank you Reyes lawn service",
        "relativeTime": "2 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Roz A",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Reyes Lawn Services responded to my online request for a quote quickly. They arranged a time to come inspect our yard and quote a price. The price was fair and later that week they provided exceptional service. This whole time they were open to questions about other improvements to our yard, costs, and options. Their communication is fantastic, letting me know the time of day they'd be arriving and then when they're on their way. We have chosen to have them consistently maintain our yard and look forward to seeing it transform back into the desert landscaping it should be!",
        "relativeTime": "5 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "laura farmer",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Reyes landscapers did an excellent job on the front and back yards. I was really amazed! I used them for the first time so i didn’t know the work yet, but they came right out and I was impressed with the attention to detail and how thorough they were. We had trimming of bushes , palms, and taking care of weeds . The clean up was immaculate and we have a pool so I thought that would be a challenge, but nope! They didn’t even get the pool dirty. Great job!",
        "relativeTime": "4 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Alexander Smyth",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I was very happy with the service I received. It was near impossible just to get anyone to even return calls/emails from other landscaping places, but Gustavo responded to my email within hours and was able to come by and provide a quote within a couple days. We had a bunch of very overgrown bushes and palm trees etc and Gustavo and his crew cleaned everything up and got it looking nice in a few hours. A whole dump truck worth of palm fronds and trimmings ended up getting hauled off. I'll definitely be giving them another call to redo our lawns and get new landscape rock as well.",
        "relativeTime": "5 years ago"
      }
