        "text": "We built a home with a completely barren desert backyard. I had no clue where to begin or how much it would cost. We told Dave we simply the wanted lowest maintenance possible, an area for cooking out, pad for future hot tub, exercise area spot for lounge chairs and possibly fire pit area. He designed several plans to choose from, including material choices, different pricing options, lighting packages, irrigation, etc. His price was on target, and we got everything we wanted without sacrificing anything for price. They started the job straight away, and it was completed before my neighbors co",
        "relativeTime": "3 years ago"
