        "rating": 5,
        "text": "My grandma, Theresa, recently had a pipe burst in her backyard that flooded her yard, driveway, and even down the street. She had to shut off the main water line, and we were worried about how to get it fixed quickly. She called Yzagere Enterprises and spoke with Paul, who reassured her right away that he could help.\n\nPaul showed up within 30 minutes, exactly when he said he would, along with another team member. They quickly got to work, dug around the pipe, fixed the leak, sealed everything, and put the yard back together perfectly. They even replaced the dirt, yard decorations, and made sur",
