        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Valley Vista is the best landscaping crew we've ever been blessed to work with.  They are kind, hard-working and honest.  The pavers are the best we have ever seen. Absolutely beautiful work done, with high quality care to make the whole backyard look amazing! They are coming back to do work in the front yard now too! We appreciate the yard completed so quickly as well. Thank you to the whole crew!! Awesome job😊",
