        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Jeremy provided a detailed bid for revamping my front yard. I had three other quotes and no one took the time to find out what we were really looking for, and get a feel for the yard.\nAs the job progressed, the little details of how they worked really shined through. The planning of the contouring and features of the front yard were meticulous. When it was discovered the sprinkler system needed some fine tuning, they did not hesitate to let me know all the options I had, and what was best for our plans. (even though that did not add any cost).\nOnce the yard was cleared and the rock started goi",
