      {
        "author": "K M",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Five stars for accommodating an urgent request - the team worked well together and were very efficient… From tall\npalm to the palo verde care and thinning, hedge shaping and debris removal. Thx so much. The only thing I would comment for improvement is regarding irrigation. Timers were set for season, but system not inspected. I learned quick to correct some minor issues since after the grounds were cleared I noticed them. lol.  Overall- highly recommend 👍 K",
        "relativeTime": "11 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Shari Bracey",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We went through several different landscape companies that charged ridiculous amounts and really left a lot to be desired. Then we found this one, and the cost was completely reasonable, we couldn't believe it! We booked them, and then got worried that since the cost was low, they might not do a great job. Wow, were we wrong! It looks incredible, they were super fast, and the communication was easy and quick. Would definitely recommend, and now we've booked them for the monthly maintenance because we were so impressed!",
        "relativeTime": "12 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Rachel Fallon",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Victor and his team are so wonderful to work with. They have great response time and then come out to observe the work needed to be done before providing a quote. Very reasonable pricing and great work! We’re always so pleased with our yard after service!",
        "relativeTime": "12 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Brooke Zoumbaris",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I have used first option for several years now when my last landscape company started raising their rates... Victor and his team always communicate well, no surprise fees, and great service when promised. Even came right over when I needed some emergency repairs and problem fixed straight away! Very pleased with services from this company.",
        "relativeTime": "12 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Sheri Coles",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "I hired First Option for a yard cleanup on a quarterly schedule.  Victor came out the very next day and walked the yard with me. He then sent a reasonable quote. I agreed and he put me on his schedule for three days later. The guys did a terrific job!  It was the first service so we will see how it goes but so far I’m thumbs up!",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Mark Goss",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I needed to get my yard back to a manageable level. I reached out to First Option, because they were my first option. They got back to me quickly and came out to my house for a job walk on a holiday! That is service. They gave me a quote within 2 hours of the job walk, then scheduled the next day! These guys don’t mess around. They showed up and got the job done quickly and efficiently. I didn’t think my yard would look this good. Make First Option your only option.",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
      }
