      {
        "author": "Tom Scott",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Lopez Landscape and Design were terrific based on the following:\n1.  They show up on time from the first appointment to the last!\n2.  Work and material is of highest quality\n3.  Design is creative and unique\n4.  Listen to what you want and deliver\n5.  Clean up at the end of each work day\n6.  Complete job on scheduled time\n7.  Everyone is professional, pleasant to work with and committed to pleasing the customer\n8.  Need we say more?  See attached photos of our transformed dirt backyard to an amazing outdoor escape!",
        "relativeTime": "7 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Scott Nagy",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We have used Lopez Landscaping for various jobs for over 15 years.  This latest job was the largest and most involved.  It included custom paver design and installation, a custom pergola, custom metalwork landscaping and lighting.  The crew worked long days and got the job done within three weeks.  We absolutely could not be happier with the results!  We now have a beautiful space to relax in.  We would not hesitate using Lopez again and highly recommend them!",
        "relativeTime": "7 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Louis Lugo",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Lopez Landscaping just completed a two day landscape project for me. The Job involved a paved walk way and over 12 tons of 1” rock in our backyard.  This company is owned and operated by The Lopez Family. Lisa runs the office and is very polite, professional and helpful. Tony is the designer and estimator. Tony patiently listened to my wife and I explained what we wanted and how disappointed we were with the original landscape company that work on our backyard 10 years ago. Tony also understood our needs and budget concerns. At first, I thought the estimate was high but when Tony explained all",
        "relativeTime": "9 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Keith&Cathy Warne",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We had a very good experience with Tony of Lopez Landscaping! We changed our minds several times in the beginning stages of our backyard landscaping and Tony was always willing to draw up new plans to meet our needs. The end result was beautiful and exceeded our expectations!! Although he was higher priced than other contractors, his quality of work, expertise, and vision was unbeatable! Would highly recommend him to anyone who is looking for any landscaping needs!",
        "relativeTime": "5 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Brian Lukas",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I would recommend Lopez Landscaping.  They installed 375 sq. feet of pavers and built a new fence column allowing us to move our gate forward.  They took their time and showed tremendous pride of workmanship.",
        "relativeTime": "7 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Susan Carstenson",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "After getting four landscaping bids, I selected Lopez Landscape to design my front and back yard and patio areas.  Tony met with me several times to go over exactly what I wanted and once the job was done he was there to ensure it was done to my expectations.  They did an outstanding job and the entire crew was accommodating, courteous and professional.  I love the finished result and my neighbors have all commented on how beautiful my home looks.  I highly recommend!",
        "relativeTime": "11 years ago"
      }
