    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Linda Serda",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "John and his entire crew are great!  I had several arms on my 30 yr old Organ Pipe cactus fall and they came out and quickly took care of them. They also trimmed a few other large arms so they would not break off. They hauled them all off and cleaned up the area around nicely.\nThey are friendly and efficient, know what they are doing and do it well!  Reasonably priced too!",
        "relativeTime": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Kelly Utykanski (KellyU)",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "John and his sons are absolutely amazing. Have employed them for years. Would use no one else. My yard looks wonderful.  Friends and neighbors remark how lovely it looks. They are friendly, professional, and very reasonable.",
        "relativeTime": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Nancy Osten",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I was referred to Diamond G Landscaping by a good friend of mine.  I needed to replace rock in my front yard and I hired John's company to complete this task. The work was completed in a professional and timely manner. I look forward to working with this company again for maintenance and any irrigation needs that I have in the future.",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Cami Smith",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I have been trying to find a landscaper for maintenance and irrigation that is dependable. I found one! I saw the Diamond G Landscaping truck out and full of debris on a rare very rainy morning last week and I thought that's pretty amazing.  I'm going to look them up.  They have great reviews so I sent in a request for a bid online through their website.  I heard back from John the owner right away.  He came out the next day and adjusted his time to accommodate my schedule. Among other things he told me why my Grapefruit tree  was failing for the last 3 years.  The irrigation was not adequate ",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Karen Bedard",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "John was easy to reach and very responsive to my needs. He fit my landscape cleanup into his busy schedule. Job was nicely done.",
        "relativeTime": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Jacqueline Merlino",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We’ve been using Diamond G Landscaping for over 4 years for trimming, removing old plants and general clean up. They come every quarter and always do a superb job. This year we signed up for an additional service.  They are doing an irrigation check once a month from May to September.  I highly recommend this service, especially if you’re away all summer.  They inspect the plants, ensure all sprinkler heads are working, and adjust watering times if needed.  This gives me peace of mind!",
        "relativeTime": "12 months ago"
      }
    ],
