        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Eric is awesome and the work is even better. We first hired Eric to do phase one of our backyard just turf and rock and adding additional pavers, we were very happy with the quality and professionalism. Then we had to replace part of our front yard after a pool install and well ans additional pavers in the back and Eric was the only person I called.\n\nWouldn’t trust anyone else for pavers or additional renovations in our yard.",
        "relativeTime": "4 months ago"
