        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Jesse was referred to us by my in-laws who were happy with his work. He was able to turn our idea of what we wanted our backyard to be into a reality and then some making it a resort style oasis for our family to enjoy. We had a few issues with the rain and some settling right after the project, but he was able to get someone out to fix it as soon as he could work it into their schedule. We definitely plan on working with him again for our frontyard when it is time to move forward with that.",
