        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Gentleman was EXTREMELY helpful and the next day he helped me again...I truly don't know how this guy knew what I said, and only 1 easy issue.... Bam I am back at home put it together and now I'm drinking a beer.\n\nCheers, salud",
