    "rating": 4.9,
    "reviewCount": 90,
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Meaghan Acker",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We received a couple quotes on our backyard and really didn’t feel confident in the companies we were interviewing until we met with Brady from Desert Pointe. From start to finish he was attentive and addressed all of our concerns. You can tell he really cares about the project and produces quality work. We are absolutely in love with our backyard!! I highly recommend desert pointe landscape!!! Thank you Brady & team!",
        "relativeTime": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Daniel “Horizon” Venegas",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "First and foremost I want to be thankful to Brady and his team! They did a phenomenal Job at making out home standout in our neighborhood! Professional crew and hardworking. There were a few hiccups but Brady did not hestitate to ensure the quality of the work was more than 100%! Highly recommend and will definitely be using him again!",
        "relativeTime": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Zachary Brown",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "From dirt to this In 3 days ! I was thrilled to finally work with desert pointe after watching there videos for years. Brady is super down to earth, very knowledgeable in the field and a great family man. His team is excellent and you can tell they love what they do ! The team works extremely hard and always smiles and has a good time while doing it. I contacted Brady letting him know I had a baby shower coming up and would like to get my back yard done and he assured me even with crazy weather and rain that him and his team could pull through which they did. Can’t wait for phase two with thes",
        "relativeTime": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Malia Lang",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Brady and his team were amazing! They brought really good energy to our backyard project and made this whole experience a positive one! They delivered on everything we asked for and went above our expectations. We love our new backyard and we’re excited to break it in. Thank you!!",
        "relativeTime": "9 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Jeanette Guerra",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We are beyond happy with our backyard landscaping project! It’s more than just landscaping - it’s a complete transformation. Brady and his team did an outstanding job and the level of detail and workmanship is no comparison to anyone else out there. Brady was able to execute our vision and handled each request we had with professionalism and timeliness. Brady was able to meet our timeline and his team worked very hard to meet our needs! We highly recommend Desert Pointe Landscaping and will definitely use them again!",
        "relativeTime": "10 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Greg Lehn",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We had an awesome experience with Desert Pointe Landscape! They completely transformed our backyard with artificial turf, pavers, trees, irrigation, lighting, and gravel. The whole process was incredibly smooth from start to finish.\n\nScheduling was super easy, communication was clear, and they finished the entire project in under a week, which honestly exceeded our expectations. The yard turned out amazing, and you can tell they take pride in their work and attention to detail.\n\nMy family and I are very happy with how everything came out, and we finally have a backyard we look forward to spend",
        "relativeTime": "4 months ago"
      }
    ],
