    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Terry Paulson",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "100 five star reviews can't be wrong. Sonora Sprinkler has lived up to their name. We had multiple leaks in the existing front yard system that required a complete new installation. Their professionalism, quality workmanship and attention to detail was outstanding. From JD providing a detailed estimate to Ryan on the job as a hands on owner, Sonora Sprinkler exceeded my expectations. The crew showed up early and ready to work both days and completed the project within the stated time frame leaving my yard in perfect condition. Ryan walked me through the installation providing clear explanation",
        "relativeTime": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Tye B",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We had some leakage in our irrigation system and had a repairman from our property management company come out. I wasn’t sure if the system was working properly and was concerned about leakage. I called Sonora and they had Mark come out to the property that same day, not only did he look over all of my lines and unclog one of them at the same time, but he also adjusted my water system so that I wouldn’t be wasting water, and at the end of it all didn't charge me a penny!This was an amazing experience, and I do plan to use them again in the future. Thank you so much Mark and Sonora Sprinkler In",
        "relativeTime": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Bob",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Great, professional company to work with. I like dealing with local, family owned businesses, which they are. I had a water leak in my control valve box. When I first discovered the leak the inside of the box was muddy with mushrooms growing in it! Skyler came out to do the job, he was on time, professional and courteous. He dug out and replaced the leaking valve with a new one and he relocated one of my irrigation risers.\nDid the whole job in about 90 minutes and left the work areas clean and tidy. Very satisfied with their work!  👍🏻",
        "relativeTime": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Larry Benson",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "It was great working with such a professional company.  JD did a great job of assessing our plants and how much water each one needs.  The quote for the irrigation system was very reasonable.  Then the work crew showed up on time and worked very hard. Great crew! The clean up was fantastic!  The rock looked like nothing had ever been disturbed. It even looked better!  And Ryan, the manager, kept us informed as to when the crew would be here and exactly what they were doing. Then Ryan set up the timer and spent time with us showing us how to use it.\nWould highly recommend Sonora Sprinkler!",
        "relativeTime": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "michell joynt",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Sonoran installed a new irrigation system. It was seamless and the crew answered all questions and were very pleasant and helpful. The service does not stop after the sale. We had a small issue and questions and they came back out within 24 hours. Ryan, Mark and the crew are so professional, helpful and responsive.  It is so appreciated! We highly recommend them!",
        "relativeTime": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Arwin Roe",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Mark of Sonora Sprinkler came to my home to consult on an irrigation issue I had and to quote the cost of repair. He spent almost 30 minutes diagnosing the problem. He found there was a third program on the controller over watering my plants. This was all done with no charge. I am impressed with their knowledge and the goodwill earned them my business if I ever need additional work.",
        "relativeTime": "5 months ago"
      }
    ],
