        "rating": 1,
        "text": "Integrity is the warranty of every good job.\n\nThe real letdown was the Owner Doug’s\nUnprofessionalism and complete unresponsiveness to any communication, dismissive attitude, and zero ownership at the finish.\n\nA sizable investment for a project left uncompleted and with many repairs. (good luck getting any communication after you make final payment)\n\nAll things follow you — your words, your choices, your silence.",
