        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I have found my new landscaper! I needed two palms (near my pool) trimmed in a hurry so I started googling and found Yahweh Tree and Landscape.  Jacob responded quickly with reasonable estimates and we scheduled service. While my initial call was for palms, once Jacob arrived, I asked if bushes could also be cut. The palms AND bushes were taken care of and I couldn’t be happier. Professional, fast and efficient services!! Thanks again Jacob!",
