        "author": "Sam Rolph",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Pool & Landscape AZ was great from start to finish. Our final product was absolutely beautiful (see pics attached), exactly what we asked for, and done in a very timely manner. I did my due diligence when selecting a company to do our backyard. I got multiple quotes, met with multiple companies and this company by far checked all of my boxes. From Jeff, Randy, and Dawn they all do their job efficiently and effectively. I appreciated that they didn't try to upsell me, or push for a more expensive design, products, vendors, etc. I told them what we wanted, they said ok, and went to work at a ver",
