        "rating": 5,
        "text": "The team at Pool & Landscape AZ were awesome! They outperformed our expectations on all fronts. So much so that we feel we may have gotten too good of a deal, haha. They were great on their price and better on their organization and timing. From the day they broke ground to water in the pool was just over 30 days. How great is that! Such a beautiful pool too. No complaints at all. Highly recommend!",
