        "rating": 5,
        "text": "2U Landscape Solutions – Years of Outstanding Service\n\nWe’ve been using Gabriel and his company, 2U Landscape Solutions, for years, and they have never disappointed. Gabriel is dependable, professional, and truly takes pride in his work. Our yard is always well-maintained, and the quality and consistency of his service over the years has been outstanding.\n\nHe’s easy to communicate with, shows up when he says he will, and always goes the extra mile to make sure everything looks great. It’s rare to find a landscaping company you can trust long-term, and Gabriel has proven time and time again tha",
