      {
        "author": "Phillip Hinkel",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "⭐️ ⭐️ ⭐️⭐️⭐️\n\n2U Landscape Solutions – Simply the Best\n\nI have used Gabriel and his team at 2U Landscape Solutions for all of my landscaping needs for over six years, and I can honestly say this is the highest level of service you could ask for. Gabriel has an incredible eye for detail and consistently keeps my property looking so pristine that it appears as if no maintenance is ever needed.\n\nWhat truly sets Gabriel apart is his professionalism, reliability, and follow-through—qualities that are rare to find today. He does exactly what he says he will do, every single time, and takes genuine p",
        "relativeTime": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Kevin",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Gabriel and his crew are absolutely phenomenal! We had a dirt yard with just a pool and were looking for someone to install artificial grass, add some travertine, do some planting, and also get some underground drainage done. Our friend recommended Gabriel, and after also getting a few quotes from others, we decided to go with him. From design to work to completion, Gabriel was very attentive to our vision, prompt and detailed in his work, and exceptionally pleasant to work with. We love our finished yard! If you are looking for a professional and quality job done, I recommend 2U Landscape Sol",
        "relativeTime": "2 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Seaprie Taft",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "This company is amazing! If you are thinking about getting landscaping done I highly recommend them. I will be using them again in the future.",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Anita Gabrielson",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We’ve used Gabriel and his team on multiple projects and have always been extremely happy with the whole project. From conception to design to completion have been a joy. We highly recommend him to our neighbors, friends and family. If you need hardscape design, 2U is the best choice!",
        "relativeTime": "2 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Steve Turner",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Hello,\nI want to state what excellent and professional work that Gabriel and his team performed at our home last week. Prior to any bid, Gabriel the owner, was able to give us clear and helpful direction on what he felt would bring out the best look for our front yard remodel. He was spot on with his suggestions and the project turned out beautifully. He never once tried to upsell, but skillfully directed our vision of what we wanted the front yard to look like. One of the best features of 2U Landscaping, is that they did everything that was required for the project, everything! 2U Landscaping",
        "relativeTime": "4 years ago"
      }
