        "author": "Shelly Phillips",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Javier and his team did an amazing job! Although it took a bit longer to complete due to the weather it was so well worth the wait. They were very communicative and thought of all the little details. Highly recommend for other neighbors as well! We love our yard and spend most days outside now!!",
