    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Paige",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "This is - hands down - the BEST landscaping company. Not only is the work amazing, but the customer service is top notch. We originally hired them for a tree removal and trimming. They did an excellent and affordable job, so we called again to get some dead plants and trees replaced. Jonathan and his team arrived early and did a excellent job. This was during the unusual heat wave, and a couple of the plants they had replaced died. Employees reached out saying that Jonathan had been in our neighborhood doing another project and noticed the plants dying. They informed us that he would be coming",
        "relativeTime": "6 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Tristan Young",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We called in for a tree removal inquiry with ABBA Landscaping and they came to our location here in Wittmann for the quote. Jonathan was very knowledgeable and explained the process and quoted an affordable rate! We had two rather large mesquite trees in front of our house less than 5-8 feet from our house (these trees are fast growing AND have thorns. Known to fall over during monsoon season too. They were bleeding into our neighbors yard here in an hoa and they needed to be pulled) They were honest and diligent with their work. We had no problem and we ended up scheduling reoccurring monthly",
        "relativeTime": "2 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Natalie Dovano",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I'm so glad I found this company. I live out of the state and recently came to check on my folks home I found half of the plants in the backyard fully dead (or so I thought). I was devastated! The owner came out fast and found the issue right away and fixed it on site and also reset the irrigation clock to make sure everything was getting the right amount of water since we are not always here. He said to give the plants a little time because they might make it. I was skeptical because they looked fried. But I just stopped by again before I head back home and sure enough they are perking up and",
        "relativeTime": "2 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Sara Davis",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "ABBA Landscape was amazing from my 1st call to payment. Timely, Professional, Cleaned up my yard looks fantastic !",
        "relativeTime": "2 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Carline Herisse",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I am very happy with the monthly landscaping service from ABBA Landscaping. I added it to our rental property and it is affordable and very convenient for both myself and my tenant.",
        "relativeTime": "2 years ago"
      }
    ],
