        "author": "Kourtney Gaylord",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Such a quick response to inquiry and came out next day for free estimate and 2 days later for yard maintenance! Communication absolutely top notch. Got us on the schedule quickly too!\n\nCrew was very professionally and friendly! Knocked out the front yard quickly and clean up was amazing and efficient. Our yard looks great!  We will be doing bi-monthly maintenance with BV Lawn Care. I look forward to our next maintenance!",
