        "author": "P S",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I recently bought my house, and the backyard was nothing but rock, two dead bushes, and a dead tree. After working with many contractors in the past, I can confidently say Arizona Living Landscape & Design has been the best experience by far.\n\nPete clearly communicated when the project would start and how long it would take—and they stuck to it. The crew was professional, respectful, and made sure to clean up at the end of each day. They completely transformed the space with new pavers, artificial turf, beautiful plants and trees, landscape lighting, and even a hot tub pad with electrical—all ",
