      {
        "author": "Fred Aldorasi",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We recently used Jurassic to demo and redo half of our backyard,  to get better use of our space and to make room for a new hot tub. Jose, was polite, professional, knowledgeable and extremely easy to work with. He held true to his word, and stayed on the projected timeline and cost estimate. When I did have some concerns or change orders, he was both responsive and quick to communicate. Overall, I would rate Jurassic exceptional… Phase 1 complete, looking forward to working with Jose and Jurassic on phase 2.",
        "relativeTime": "2 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Iris C Jones",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I had a fantastic experience with Jurassic landscape. It started with the customer service being friendly and timely. Jose came and evaluated the project and sent over a quote within 48hrs. They started the project and it only took them 4 days to complete. Everyone was respectful of my property and the craftsmanship is top notch. I would highly recommend them to anyone that is looking for any landscape/hardscape work. We had a sprinkler systems installed, drainage system installed, rock spread across the yard and raised wall, and a cover for the pool equipment installed.",
        "relativeTime": "3 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Andrea and Everse P",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We are so happy with our amazing backyard thanks to Jurassic Landscaping!  The paver patios, putting green, artificial turf and river rock couldn’t be more perfect. We love the flower bushes that line the back of the pool. We went from unusable dirt to a backyard oasis!",
        "relativeTime": "3 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Pamela",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Jurassic hardscape and Landscape has designed and built the front and backyards on four of our homes over the years. Great family owned company that believes in keeping promises, being on time, and making sure you are 110% happy with the final product. A joy to work with.",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Amanda Cinq-Mars",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "They did an amazing job on my front yard with rocks and landscape design! I am not good with coming up with a design and they came up with something so perfect. Highly recommend for quick and fast/great landscape service!!",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Laura Anne Duprey",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Jose has completed two separate projects at my home over the last 6 months. From creating a full landscape design in phases to execution, Jose and his crew have been communicative, easy to work with & always on time.  Bottom line: Jurassic delivers quality work & materials, an easy process and beautiful outcomes! Looking forward to the next phase.",
        "relativeTime": "2 years ago"
      }
