      {
        "author": "Stefan Metrakos",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "If you're looking for the best landscaping for a reasonable price in the San Tan Valley/Queen Creek area, you've found it. Daniel and his team provided landscaping services for our home for over two years. Every time we needed work done, Daniel got us into his schedule incredibly quickly. He's trustworthy, very skilled, and just a good man. You really can't go wrong hiring M & D landscaping.",
        "relativeTime": "2 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Toni Murbach",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We used M & D Landscaping several times now. They installed pavers, weed clean up,  spread gravel in our front and back yard and are helping bring our grass back to life. They are very hard working, dependable and do quality work for a fair price. Thank you M & D for another job well done!",
        "relativeTime": "2 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Karen Gatlin",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Not only did they provide a free estimate, get us on the schedule quickly and transform our front yard into a beautiful desert landscape, they let me know they’d be refunding some money due to not using the same amount of rock in the estimate. Not many businesses these days would do that! I would highly recommend them and will be contacting them when we’re ready to do our back yard.",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Baylie Carroll",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Best landscaping company in town. One thing with landscaping companies is finding reliability. That's just it with this one! They have been doing my yard now for almost 6 years now. You won't regret hiring them!",
        "relativeTime": "1 year ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Karen Jordan",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Very happy with the work of M & D Landscaping!! Daniel and his crew were very knowledgeable, courteous, and professional throughout the whole process. Project was completed quickly. We highly recommend them for your landscaping needs!",
        "relativeTime": "3 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Martin Staufenberg",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Have engaged with M&D since 2019, first to help with a tree felled by a storm and then for end-of-year tree and shrub trimming.  I regularly engage Daniel and his team for spraying pre-energent and tree/shrub trimming, drip-line maintenance as well as other landscaping needs like when re-rocking the yard.  On that point, Daniel sourced multiple rock providers to get the right match of existing rock in the size I was looking for.  I was very impressed with his desire to get it just-right.  He will take the time to get what you envision and strive to match it.",
        "relativeTime": "3 years ago"
      }
