        "author": "Angelique Hoefl",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Great Experience at the Nursery 🌵🌳 Lots of beautiful plants, trees, cacti, and some herbs and vegetables. We bought a nice plant and got instructions for watering. The staff was very nice and helpful. Thanks. We'll come back ☺️",
