      {
        "author": "Paul",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Friendly and very helpful.   We purchased a few cacti and other plants to landscape our new home.  They wrote down how to take care of everything we purchased.   They helped us load the truck.  We will be purchasing trees from them in the fall.\n\nThey went above and beyond for us.\n\nUpdate:  We purchased three trees and various other plants.  They were delivered on time.  We couldn't be more pleased with this local business!  The photographs are our purchases from this nursery.",
        "relativeTime": "8 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Matthew Watson",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Do not go anywhere else but here! I received the best customer service and what looks like a top quality product. They treat there plants like they are precious cargo. Everyone was so helpful. They spent the time to explain how to properly plant and water. They have forgotten more than any of us will know about Arizona plants. This is my new place!",
        "relativeTime": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Brian Sweet",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "This is a really great nursery!  The guys that run this place are very friendly and knowledgeable, but aren’t pushy or overbearing.  They always have a great selection of plants that do well locally.  They also give great advice regarding care, maintenance, what not to plant, etc. They’ve even been so kind as to call me when a plant that I was looking for comes back in stock.   Check these guys out.  You’ll be glad you did.",
        "relativeTime": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Christina Cavazos",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We needed a tree and some bushes to satisfy our HOA landscape requirements and Dave from Jackrabbit Nursery helped us find what we needed. He made the experience easy and gave us the knowledge and supplies we would need for successful planting! This is my 2nd time buying from this small business and I don’t regret it! 100% satisfied with the plant quality, prices and kind customer service!!! Thanks Dave!",
        "relativeTime": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Jennifer Roney",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "My husband went to pick out a new tree to replace the one in the front yard and Mike was extremely helpful. We didn't know what kind of tree the old one was, but Mike knew just by looking at the picture. We opted for delivery and Mike delivered the tree and even carried it to a temporary holding place for us. The customer service was excellent! Definitely recommend!",
        "relativeTime": "6 months ago"
      }
