        "author": "Tony Scardina",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Roy the store manager hook me up big time not only did he have the part I needed He gave me a great deal on it showed me some install tips and was super kind very knowledgeable They also are bilingual they speak Spanish so if you have anybody who needs translation these guys do a great job. After a walk through the store there wasn't anything that I could see that they did not have from drip line to electrical buried tables and all the in connectors all the proper equipment to do everything you would need to complete a job correctly I was highly impressed and they are very kind",
