        "text": "Manny and his team just installed pavers, a flower planter and a raised vegetable garden at my home.  Everything was perfect, and Manny kept me informed the whole time.  It was a big job and they finished it in just four days.  Prestige Landscaping is highly recommended!",
        "relativeTime": "4 months ago"
