        "text": "Latte Stone did exactly what we asked of them, and it looks better than I could have imagined. His team was very professional and kind. His work is unmatched and he has a true skill for what he does. He made sure everything was done right the first time. I am picky and pay attention to detail. I didn’t feel like there was anything I would change about our yard. Would highly recommend anyone hire him!",
        "relativeTime": "9 months ago"
