        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Mac came to my house when I had an emergency irrigation problem in the front yard. He listened to my issue and came to the conclusion that I had a problem with my irrigation box. I had too many times running. He showed me how to work the box and system. No charge. A good human being with the ability to teach us how to use our systems. Highly recommend.",
        "relativeTime": "11 months ago"
