        "rating": 5,
        "text": "My husband and I were so excited to see this vision become a reality. We absolutely love our backyard and pool. Dino and his crews did a great job! I was especially impressed at the level of detail by each crew. They really seem like masters of their trades. The waterfall sounds beautiful and is perfectly relaxing. Don't mind some of the palms looking rough - my husband and I planted them just before a heat wave in July - oops!",
