    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Justin Straquadine",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Desert Plant Collection is outstanding! Agnes is not only a wonderful person but is knowledgeable, skilled and reliable. Her nursery has a wide variety of beautiful trees, palms, and flowers. I've got a Brazilian-pepper tree last year, a Bottle-brush tree and palm recently and I will undoubtedly continue going to Desert Plant Collection in the future! Agnes and her team are a gem here in Maricopa.",
        "relativeTime": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Karin Isaacson",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Agnes helped me redesign a very boring basic back and front yard into a wonderful desert oasis. She listened to my ideas, jumped in with even better ideas and most importantly listened to what I wanted and what my budget was. I couldn’t be more pleased with the results. She and her team worked hard, worked quickly and kept me informed and involved every step of the way. As a single woman, I loved working with another woman - she listened to me and was ok with me changing my mind! She repositioned my current plants, added palms and cacti and more colors for variety. I highly recommend Agnes!! T",
        "relativeTime": "2 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "A H",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We hired Agnes and her installation crew for a hardscape backyard renovation project. Our backyard is beyond what we could’ve imagined. Agnes gave recommendations based on our vision and helped us design an oasis. In addition to a complete irrigation system, they installed palms, shade trees, ocotillos, agaves, & a citrus tree. She helped us determine the best layout to compliment our rectangular landscape. She/team were responsive, prompt, and accommodating. I would highly recommend them without reservations. Best investment ever! Thanks so much Agnes for your professionalism and for helping ",
        "relativeTime": "4 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Mike Crook",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Our.experience with Agnus was top notch from start to finish. She has one of the most impressive selections of plants and trees in the area. We are not originally from the area and we’re extremely pleased with her expertise and willingness to create a plan that worked best for us and our backyard. She follows the project in person from start to finish. We highly recommend Agnus and her very professional and hard working crew. They dealt with the planting, installed and made sure all the plant were properly irrigated.",
        "relativeTime": "2 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Steve Fowler",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Agness and her crew were Fantastic, very professional, cleaned up after their selves. I would highly recommend them. And if you have not visited her nursery, you need to it is awesome. Absolutely spotless and she has everything you need. Very very nice lady.\n\nThanks, Agness from the Fowler’s",
        "relativeTime": "2 years ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "S Cardona",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Agnes and her team did a complete makeover to my backyard! We just moved to this house and we had absolutely nothing going on (except some dead grass)and they turned it into a beautiful oasis! Can’t wait until my privacy hedge is all big and full! Agnes is very knowledgeable and will help you design your dream backyard! They also  did the job for a fraction of what you could pay at a Moons Valley! A Gem! Will be back for more, Love this place!",
        "relativeTime": "4 years ago"
      }
    ],
